级报告改为在 GitHub 公开提交","summary":"curl 项目宣布自 2026 年 10 月 26 日起，LOW 与 MEDIUM 级别的漏洞报告须改以 GitHub 议题形式公开提交，仅 HIGH 与 CRITICAL 级仍留在 HackerOne 私密处理。此举源于近年来超过 90% 的提交被判定低于 HIGH，维护团队在 AI 驱动的报告洪峰下不堪重负。公开流程可让更多人参与评估与修复审查，但也给攻击者留下了稍长的利用窗口。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://daniel.haxx.se/blog/2026/10/20/do-minor-curl-vulnerabilities-in-the-open/","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T19:47:54.578Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"ki3zb95t0pe6mf159mrxle3wc"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"OpenSSL 4.1.0 发布，新增 DTLS 1.3 支持并列出四项已知问题","summary":"OpenSSL 4.1.0 是一个功能版本，新增 DTLS 1.3（RFC 9147）、RFC 8701 GREASE、SSL 监听器 API 的 DTLS 支持、IKEV2 KDF 以及 Elbrus2000（e2k）架构的初步支持。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/openssl/openssl/releases/tag/openssl-4.1.0","publishedAt":"2026-10-23T12:42:44.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"ur28hceb46iz0gdzsiv2clohz"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Railway 发布 10 月 21 日安全事件初步报告：至多 1.85% 工作区环境变量可能泄露","summary":"Railway 在博客发布 10 月 21 日安全事件的初步报告，称攻击自 10 月 20 日 13:58 UTC 持续至 10 月 22 日 03:32 UTC，攻击者入侵部分内部系统，目标是获取 AI 服务商 API 密钥以进行蒸馏攻击。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://blog.railway.com/p/preliminary-report-october-security-incident","publishedAt":"2026-10-23T18:35:24.152Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"kkat6xrf9m9i1tw3oorsy09kz"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"eMudhra 八张 SSL 中间证书泄露，HTTPS 连接信任链受威胁","summary":"eMudhra 的八张 SSL 中间证书被公开泄露，HTTPS 连接信任链受到威胁。浏览器已撤销这些证书，但 curl 等库仍接受它们，作者提供了验证 PoC。后续更正指出该 CA 仅用 8 位随机数生成密钥，其中一个密钥为 '4'，建议检查所有 Docker 容器是否受影响。","sourceName":"Reddit r/selfhosted","sourceUrl":"https://www.reddit.com/r/selfhosted/comments/1xaubjf/leaked_ssl_certificates_no_https_connection_can/","publishedAt":"2026-10-20T14:55:55.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"e4oucxp0z50vforq6fo517zua"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"QPACK 头部放大攻击影响 10 个 HTTP/3 实现中的 7 个","summary":"FoxIO 的研究发现，远程未认证客户端可让 HTTP/3 服务器分配比发送数据多几十到上千倍的内存，一条连接即可让默认配置的服务器 OOM 或被钉死；测试的 10 个实现中 7 个受影响。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://foxio.io/blog/header-accordions-qpack-amplification-attacks-against-http-3-servers","publishedAt":"2026-10-22T15:15:44.372Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"kqclisnpnmgemcydxx1bcf42z"}]},{"label":"基础设施","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"GitHub 解析把 99.99999% 仓库迁到 Azure 后的 Git 基础设施改造","summary":"GitHub 官方博客介绍其把 99.99999% 仓库复制到 Azure 的迁移进展与后续架构改造：首个仓库副本于 2025 年 8 月落地 Azure Central US 区域，如今多数仓库的 5 个副本中有 2 个在 Azure，Azure 承担约一半 Git 流量，剩余最繁忙仓库受限于约 25ms 的跨区域往返延迟。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://github.blog/en